From: electron11-16k maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] PartitionAlloc: satisfy Chromium 87's complex-struct check

Chromium 87's Clang style plugin requires structures containing atomics to
declare an explicit out-of-line constructor.  Newer Chromium versions no
longer apply this exact check to PageCharacteristics.

Add constexpr out-of-line constructors to both allocator copies.  constexpr
also keeps the global instances constant-initialized under
-Wglobal-constructors.
---
 .../partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h               | 1 +
 .../partition_allocator/partition_address_space.cc                | 3 +++
 .../partition_allocator/page_allocator.cc                         | 3 +++
 .../partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h                | 1 +
 4 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h b/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h
--- a/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h
+++ b/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h
@@ -45,1 +45,2 @@
+  constexpr PageCharacteristics();
   std::atomic<int> size;
diff --git a/base/allocator/partition_allocator/partition_address_space.cc b/base/allocator/partition_allocator/partition_address_space.cc
--- a/base/allocator/partition_allocator/partition_address_space.cc
+++ b/base/allocator/partition_allocator/partition_address_space.cc
@@ -81,1 +81,4 @@
+constexpr PageCharacteristics::PageCharacteristics()
+    : size(0), shift(0) {}
+
 PageCharacteristics page_characteristics;
diff --git a/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator.cc b/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator.cc
--- a/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator.cc
+++ b/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator.cc
@@ -262,1 +262,4 @@
+constexpr PageCharacteristics::PageCharacteristics()
+    : size(0), shift(0) {}
+
 PageCharacteristics page_characteristics;
diff --git a/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h b/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h
--- a/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h
+++ b/third_party/pdfium/third_party/base/allocator/partition_allocator/page_allocator_constants.h
@@ -46,1 +46,2 @@
+  constexpr PageCharacteristics();
   std::atomic<int> size;
-- 
2.51.0
